docs {
  # imei-check — local API collection

  Point at a running server (`npm run dev`) and hit **Run** on any request.

  Every request carries assertions, so this collection is not just a set of examples — it is an
  executable check of the rules the service must never break:

  - an unknown TAC is `inconclusive`, never `pass`
  - no response ever contains the full 15-digit IMEI
  - every section carries `coverage`, `checked_at` and its evidence
  - `/readyz` never depends on a provider

  Test IMEIs live in the **Local** environment as variables, so no request file contains a
  15-digit number. That is deliberate: `apps/api/test/sentinel.test.ts` greps the whole repo for
  them.
}
